
    Rotel Dip Recipe


    Classic 3 Ingredient Rotel Dip

    Ingredients
    1 can (10 oz) **Ro*Tel** Diced Tomatoes & Green Chilies
    16 oz block **Velveeta** Original Cheese, cubed
    1 lb lean ground beef (or sausage)

    Instructions
    1. Brown the ground beef in a large skillet over medium-high heat until no pink remains.
    2. Drain off any excess grease from the pan.
    3. Reduce the heat to medium-low and add the cubed Velveeta cheese and the entire can of RoTel (including the liquid) to the skillet.
    4. Stir constantly until the cheese is completely melted and the dip is smooth and creamy.
    5. Serve warm with tortilla chips or crackers.
    
